// ============================================================
// ⛔ STYLE RULES — READ BEFORE EDITING ANY COMPONENT
// ============================================================
// COLOURS: Only use C.* tokens. Zero hardcoded hex anywhere.
//   Primary action / CTA        → C.clay, C.clayT, C.clayD
//   Text hierarchy              → C.ink, C.ink2, C.ink3, C.ink4
//   Card/surface backgrounds    → #fff, C.surf, C.surf2
//   Dividers                    → C.rule, C.rule2
//   Status: stable              → C.ok / C.okT   (via bdg())
//   Status: changed             → C.warn / C.warnT (via bdg())
//   Status: new/info            → C.blue / C.blueT (via bdg())
//   C.gold / C.rose / C.sage   → BACKGROUND ACCENT ONLY, never on text/badges/tags
//
// BADGES: Always use bdg('stable'|'changed'|'new'|'clay'). Never hand-roll.
//
// FILTER TABS: Active = C.clay fill + white text. Inactive = #fff + C.rule border + C.ink2 text.
//              NEVER colour inactive tabs with category colours.
//
// TYPE LABELS (category tags, inline meta): C.ink3 text + small icon. No background pill.
//
// FONT SIZES (token scale):
//   32px+  → hero stats (C.clay)
//   18-22px → card/section heading (C.ink, 700)
//   15-16px → body primary (C.ink, 500-600)
//   14px    → body default (C.ink2)
//   13px    → caption/meta (C.ink3)
//   12px    → micro/date (C.ink4)
//   11px    → badges/overline (mono, 0.06em uppercase)
//
// FONT OBJECTS: Always spread ...sans, ...mono, or ...disp. Never write fontFamily inline.
//
// CARDS: Always spread ...CARD. borderRadius:14 standard, 16 for hero, 12 for buttons.
//
// SHADOWS: Cards → '0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.05)'
//          Clay buttons → '0 3px 10px rgba(199,120,94,.30)'
//          Never invent new shadow values.
//
// SPACING: Multiples of 4 only (4,8,12,16,20,24,28,32).
// ============================================================

const DAD_PHOTO = 'data:image/png;base64,';

